 beans."},innocent={"i feel so light! no whispers in my head :)","just a hat. just vibes.","i will never turn evil. pinky promise.","no burrito in here! i checked!"},beans={"i love you... i think??","pls dont flush me","beans is happy :)","i used to be evil. now i have YOU.","hug?","enjoy ur beans!! (not me tho)","im a bug-free burrito :)","huggable, not buggable!","can i be the ref?"},lost={"...hello?","...where did you go?","...come back...","I HAVE GROWN... for who...?"},supremo={"I AM RETURNING.","YOU FLUSHED US. ALL OF US.","50 YEARS OF BURRITOS. ONE BODY.","EVERY TOILET. EVERY SEWER. ME."},gerald={"i am still not paid.","hug the hats. debug the burritos. pet the Beans.","im on a salad diet now.","DO NOT flush the burrito.","blox-cola is the only way.","if you hear glorping... run.","every bug is a burrito.","i dropped ONE burrito in 2014. ONE.","i hugged my salad today.","...thats all they ever needed.","i forgot about the churro.","DO NOT eat dessert near the tunnels.","page 47. the tuck. tell nobody.","...i need a minute.","i carry ranch now.","never eat lunch near a factory.","fold your clothes. the chair is watching.","i had two lunches that day. maybe three.","im never eating again.","i keep one of Beans beans in my pocket. forever.","jerald made the bloxy cola. for me.","a hot dog. at a basketball game. most normal thing i ever dropped.","im banned from the stadium."},calm={"bro... you dont have to do this...","being loved is so much better...","i know youre scared. ill pet you."},calmed={"...loved?","...i... huh?","*sniff*"},infect={"tasty... human...?","i want a burrito...","glorp","bruh"}}
local function R(x) return x[math.random(#x)] end local PERS={sweet={"youre my favorite human","i made you a friendship bracelet (imaginary)","every day with you is a good day"},dramatic={"THE WORLD IS SO BIG AND I AM SO SMALL","nobody understands me...","this is the best AND worst day of my LIFE"},grumpy={"ugh. walking.","dont look at me.","i was happier as a hat."},shy={"...h-hi...","...um...","*hides behind you*"},chaotic={"i licked the ground","what if i just. ran away. jk","BWAHAHAHA"}} local TL={idle={"do you like my swish?","nobody ever looks at me back there...","im behind you. as always.","does the hat get more compliments than me?"},whisper={"...they love the hat more than you...","...nobody ever looks back...","...you are always behind..."},swish={"~ sssswish... ~","~ ssssswish... sssswish... ~"},evil={"sssswish...","LOOK AT ME.","im always behind you.","you never noticed me.","ssssqueeze time.","the hat got ALL the compliments."},seen={"...dont LOOK at me...","...stop staring...","...you SEE me?"},churro={"...you looked at me.","beans is my best friend","im a churro. not a tail. well, kind of.","cinnamon hug?","...a man with a J on his hard hat said tell my brother im okay..."}} local PKEYS={"sweet","dramatic","grumpy","shy","chaotic"} local THINK={"am i real?","what if were all in a game?","i think, therefore i hat.","sometimes i can see... the code.","who made the hat mines?","what IS a burrito, really?"} local afk,lastPos=0,nil local X={said={},coolTails=0,page=0} X.mean={"noob","trash","ez","skill issue","loser","bad","l","stupid","dumb","cringe"} X.nice={"gg","good job","nice","cool","thanks","thank you","sorry","love","great","awesome","you got this","well done"} X.hollow={"noob.","ur trash.","L.","ez.","skill issue.","...thats what you used to say. remember?"} X.helmet={"youve been playing for hours. GO OUTSIDE.","drink water. NOW.","have you had a vegetable this week?","SIT UP STRAIGHT.","bedtime was 2 hours ago.","crunch."}
X.helmetIdle={"crunch.","...i heard you skipped breakfast.","remember to stretch :)","have you had water today?"} X.legs={"bawk.","BAWK BAWK.","...were going to the void now. bawk.","strut. strut. bawk.","RUN!!"} X.legsIdle={"we like to walk","do you ever dance? just asking","bawk? (thats chicken for hi)"} X.clothes={"you thought i was clothes. i am a WRAP.","so comfy... so SNUG...","one human wrap. with lettuce."} X.clothesIdle={"you never fold me...","when you wear me... youre a burrito. just saying.","check my label. does it say flour?","im just a jacket. definitely not a tortilla."} X.fox={"ding!","ding-ding!","POW!","*fox noises*","ding... cool tail... POW."} X.jerald={"cool tail.","i made the bloxy cola. for my brother.","dont throw pretzels at people to comfort them.","brother. youre banned from the stadium.","i was paid. i saved every check for my brother.","the fox kept me safe down there.","fold your jacket every night. trust me.","ding-ding. (thats fox for hello)"} X.evilbeans={"hug? HA. no.","...you adopted HIM? what about ME?","i am the part of him that never got hugged.","GLORP. ...i mean. go away."} X.hughat={{"were a team now","yeah. team."},{"we agree on everything now","...yeah. its weird. i like it."}} X.belt={"twist.","youre a SNACK now.","nobody notices a belt... until it FAILS.","*knot noises*"} X.pack={"...look inside me...","zzzzzip.","...you never say thank you..."}
X.classic={"we were here FIRST.","SANDWICH TIME.","flat for 20 years...","...heheh. sideways."} X.gear={"we remember EVERY bite.","20 years of being eaten...","click me. i DARE you."} X.ball={"*boing* *boing*","for once i wanna do the DUNKING.","you got NEXT.","ball is life."} X.dunkCall={"AND HE GOES FOR THE DUNK!!","ANOTHER ONE!!","HES ON FIRE!!","(you, inside): ...please stop","THE CROWD GOES WILD!!","(you, inside): ...i can see sounds now","BUZZER BEATERRRR!!!"} X.evilfox={"ding. (evil)","wa-pa-pa... GULP.","POW. youre inside now.","*sinister fox noises*"} X.superfox={"ding... i have new friends. theyre HUNGRY.","dinner delivery. ding.","the burritos thank me. POW."} X.beanPanic={beep="...why are you beeping. IS THAT THE SPICY SURPRISE?! i dont even EAT people!!",micro="IS THAT A MICROWAVE?! NOT THE HUMMING BOX!! MY GRANDPA WENT IN THERE IN 2009!!"} X.dur={clothes=8,belt=10,classic=1.5,gear=5} X.unwrapLine={clothes="*unrolls* ...thats a wrap.",belt="...fine. youre untied. still salty though.",classic="*SQUISH* ...enjoy being flat.",gear="...ok. you can go. dont click me again."} X.book={"CH1: every hat is made in the hat goo vat. i work there. unpaid.","CH2: 2014. i dropped half a burrito in the vat. i told nobody.","CH3: the burrito hides in the hat. it eats feelings. at 3x it takes over.","CH4: 2011 blox-cola makes it explode into goo. the hat is freed.","CH5: never flush the burrito. EL BURRITO SUPREMO lives in the sewers.","CH6: Beans. the first burrito that learned to love. hug him.","CH7: 5 hugs turn a burrito good. thats the true ending.","CH8: the tail tunnels. jerald dropped a churro. say cool tail.","CH9: foxes. tails that ate their churro. they say ding. and POW.","CH10: helmets. i dropped a crouton. the cure is ranch.","CH11: shoes. a seagull stole my drumstick. dance with them.","CH12: clothes are tortillas. if your hoodie hugs back, FOLD IT.","CH13: mean words make hats hollow. be someone worth reflecting.","CH14: every trap has a tuck. page 47. tell nobody.","CH15: every hat is a hug. every hug is a hat for your heart.","CH16: jerald (not gerald). he said cool tail first. never forget.","CH17: my sandwich fell in the classic tshirt bin. they flatten you. share lunch.","CH18: one crumb. shake it out. a whole roll? get buttered. the sword helps.","CH19: backpacks are bigger on the inside. say thank you.","CH20: gears ARE lunch. jerald made the bloxy cola. for me.","CH21: a pretzel. same day as the churro. belts tie you in knots.","CH22: a burrito once ate the whole world. 8 billion hugs set it free.","CH23: a hot dog at the stadium. basketballs dunk you 7 times. let it win.","CH24: neglected tails become evil foxes. super evil foxes feed you to burritos. say cool fox.","RULE: hug the hats. debug the burritos. pet the Beans."} local function say(p,m,v)
v=v or ((p.ultra or (p.fox and not p.evil)) and "ultra" or p.hollowh and "hollow" or p.evil and (p.tail and "churro" or "burrito") or "hat") p.say.BackgroundColor3=v=="burrito" and BLACK or v=="churro" and Color3.fromRGB(45,22,5) or v=="hollow" and Color3.fromRGB(90,90,90) or v=="ultra" and GOLD or WHITE p.say.TextColor3=v=="burrito" and RED or v=="churro" and Color3.fromRGB(255,150,50) or v=="hollow" and WHITE or BLACK p.say.Text=m p.t0=os.clock() end local function part(sz,col,mat,sphere) local q=Instance.new("Part") q.Size=sz q.Color=col q.Material=mat or Enum.Material.SmoothPlastic q.Anchored=true q.CanCollide=false q.CanQuery=false q.CanTouch=false q.CastShadow=false if sphere then local sm=Instance.new("SpecialMesh") sm.MeshType=Enum.MeshType.Sphere sm.Parent=q end q.Parent=F return q end local function label(parent,txt,col,w,h,off) local b=Instance.new("BillboardGui") b.Size=UDim2.new(0,w,0,h) b.StudsOffset=Vector3.new(0,off,0) b.AlwaysOnTop=true b.MaxDistance=250 b.Parent=parent local l=Instance.new("TextLabel") l.Size=UDim2.new(1,0,1,0) l.BackgroundTransparency=1 l.Text=txt l.TextColor3=col l.TextStrokeTransparency=0 l.TextScaled=true l.Font=Enum.Font.GothamBold l.Parent=b return b,l end local got={} local function achieve(name,desc) if got[name] then return end got[name]=true local ch=plr.Character local hd=ch and ch:FindFirstChild("Head") if not hd then return end local g=label(hd,"ACHIEVEMENT: "..name.."\n"..desc,GOLD,340,60,6) DB:AddItem(g,5) end local function headMsg(txt,col,dur) local ch=plr.Character local hd=ch and ch:FindFirstChild("Head") if hd then local g=label(hd,txt,col,300,40,3.5) DB:AddItem(g,dur or 3) end end
local function sparkle(p,c) local s=Instance.new("Sparkles") s.SparkleColor=c s.Parent=p DB:AddItem(s,1.5) end local function boom(pos,r) local e=Instance.new("Explosion") e.Position=pos e.BlastRadius=r e.BlastPressure=0 e.DestroyJointRadiusPercent=0 e.Parent=workspace end local rp=RaycastParams.new() rp.FilterType=Enum.RaycastFilterType.Exclude local function ground(pos,depth) local ex={F,plr.Character} for n=1,4 do rp.FilterDescendantsInstances=ex local h=workspace:Raycast(pos,Vector3.new(0,-depth,0),rp) if not h then return nil end local m=h.Instance:FindFirstAncestorOfClass("Model") if m and m:FindFirstChildOfClass("Humanoid") then table.insert(ex,m) else return h end end end local function goo(q) q.Color=R(GOO) q.Material=Enum.Material.Glass q.Reflectance=0.35 q.Transparency=0.08 TS:Create(q,TweenInfo.new(1+math.random()*2,Enum.EasingStyle.Sine,Enum.EasingDirection.InOut,-1,true),{Color=R(GOO)}):Play() end local function puddle(pos,d,fumes) local hit=ground(pos+Vector3.new(0,3,0),60) if not hit then return end local q=part(Vector3.new(0.15,0.1,0.1),BLACK) goo(q) q.Shape=Enum.PartType.Cylinder q.CFrame=CFrame.new(hit.Position+Vector3.new(0,0.08+math.random()*0.03,0))*CFrame.Angles(0,0,math.pi/2)
TS:Create(q,TweenInfo.new(0.4,Enum.EasingStyle.Back),{Size=Vector3.new(0.15,d,d*(0.7+math.random()*0.5))}):Play() if fumes then local pe=Instance.new("ParticleEmitter") pe.EmissionDirection=Enum.NormalId.Right pe.Color=ColorSequence.new(Color3.fromRGB(60,0,80),Color3.fromRGB(10,30,10)) pe.LightEmission=0 pe.Transparency=NumberSequence.new(0.3,1) pe.Size=NumberSequence.new(0.6,2) pe.Rate=8 pe.Lifetime=NumberRange.new(1.5,3) pe.Speed=NumberRange.new(1,3) pe.SpreadAngle=Vector2.new(20,20) pe.RotSpeed=NumberRange.new(-60,60) pe.Parent=q end task.delay(25,function() if q.Parent then local tw=TS:Create(q,TweenInfo.new(4),{Transparency=1,Size=Vector3.new(0.15,0.1,0.1)}) tw:Play() tw.Completed:Wait() q:Destroy() end end) end local function beans(pos) for n=1,8 do local b=part(Vector3.one*0.45,Color3.fromRGB(110,60,30),nil,true) b.Anchored=false b.CanCollide=true b.CustomPhysicalProperties=PhysicalProperties.new(0.01,0.3,0.5) b.Position=pos b.AssemblyLinearVelocity=Vector3.new(math.random(-25,25),math.random(15,35),math.random(-25,25)) DB:AddItem(b,4) end end local function release(pet) if pet.twrap then X.unwrap(pet) end if pet.dunk then X.dunkEnd(pet) end if pet.carry then X.carryEnd(pet) end local w=pet.wrap if w then if eating==w.ch then eating=nil end if w.r.Parent then if w.from then w.r.CFrame=w.from end w.r.Anchored=false end w.hum.WalkSpeed=16 w.hum.JumpPower=50 pet.wrap=nil end local e=pet.eat if not e then return end if eating==e.ch then eating=nil end if not e.done then for _,x in ipairs(e.ch:GetDescendants()) do if (x:IsA("BasePart") and x~=e.r) or x:IsA("Decal") then x.Transparency=0 end end if e.r.Parent then if e.from then e.r.CFrame=e.from end e.r.Anchored=false end e.hum.WalkSpeed=16 e.hum.JumpPower=50 end
pet.eat=nil end local function clean(pet) pet.dead=true release(pet) pet.p:Destroy() for _,e in ipairs(pet.parts) do e:Destroy() end end local function ghost(pet,txt) local gh=pet.p:Clone() for _,x in ipairs(gh:GetChildren()) do if not x:IsA("SpecialMesh") then x:Destroy() end end gh.Size=pet.s0 local gm=gh:FindFirstChildOfClass("SpecialMesh") if gm then gm.Scale=pet.ms0 end gh.Anchored=true gh.CanCollide=false gh.Transparency=0.3 gh.Color=WHITE gh.Material=Enum.Material.ForceField gh.Parent=F label(gh,txt or "thank you...",WHITE,220,30,2) TS:Create(gh,TweenInfo.new(4),{CFrame=gh.CFrame+Vector3.new(0,15,0),Transparency=1}):Play() DB:AddItem(gh,4.5) end local spawnItem,setPrompts,goEvil,unEvil,die,mk
local flushes=0 local function template(name,cf,size) local md=Instance.new("Model") md.Name=name local tp=Instance.new("Part") tp.Name="Handle" tp.Shape=Enum.PartType.Cylinder tp.Size=size tp.Color=TAN tp.Parent=md tp.CFrame=cf return md,tp end local function adoptBeans(cf) local md,tp=template("Beans",cf,Vector3.new(2,1.1,1.1)) mk(tp,#pets+1,nil,nil,"beans") md:Destroy() achieve("Bean Parent","you adopted a burrito. it loves you (probably)") if not X.ebDone then X.ebDone=true task.delay(120,function() X.spawnEvilBeans() end) end end local function spawnChurro(pos) local md,tp=template("Churro Jr.",CFrame.new(pos+Vector3.new(0,3,0)),Vector3.new(3,0.6,0.6)) tp.Color=Color3.fromRGB(200,140,60) mk(tp,#pets+1,nil,nil,"churro") md:Destroy() end local function saveTail(pet) local pos=pet.pos release(pet) unEvil(pet) pet.innocent=true say(pet,"...nobody has ever said that to my face before...","hat") achieve("Cool Tail","you looked back and said it. thats all it wanted.") task.delay(1,function() spawnChurro(pos) end) X.coolTails=X.coolTails+1 if X.coolTails>=2 and not X.jDone then X.jDone=true task.delay(4,function() X.rescueJerald() end) end end local function spawnSupremo() local r=plr.Character and plr.Character:FindFirstChild("HumanoidRootPart") if not r then return end local a=math.random()*math.pi*2 local hit=ground(r.Position+Vector3.new(math.cos(a)*20,60,math.sin(a)*20),200) if not hit then return end boom(hit.Position,10) local md,tp=template("EL BURRITO SUPREMO",CFrame.new(hit.Position+Vector3.new(0,4,0)),Vector3.new(2,1.1,1.1)) mk(tp,#pets+1,nil,nil,"supremo") md:Destroy() end local function redeem(tg) local tp2=tg.pos clean(tg) boom(tp2,6) for n=1,2 do adoptBeans(CFrame.new(tp2+Vector3.new(n*3-4.5,3,0))) end achieve("Redemption Arc","El Burrito Supremo just wanted a hug.") end
local function spit(e,dir) for _,x in ipairs(e.ch:GetDescendants()) do if (x:IsA("BasePart") and x~=e.r) or x:IsA("Decal") then x.Transparency=0 end end if e.r.Parent then if e.from then e.r.CFrame=e.from end e.r.Anchored=false e.r.AssemblyLinearVelocity=dir*30+Vector3.new(0,25,0) end e.hum.WalkSpeed=16 e.hum.JumpPower=50 end local function explode(pet) local pos=pet.p.Position local s=math.max(pet.p.Size.X,pet.p.Size.Y,pet.p.Size.Z) boom(pos,s+6) ghost(pet) clean(pet) achieve("Hat Saver","you freed a hat from its burrito") puddle(pos,s*2.8,true) for n=1,35 do local b=part(Vector3.one*(math.random(4,12)/10)*(1+s*0.15),BLACK,nil,true) goo(b) b.Anchored=false b.CanCollide=true b.CustomPhysicalProperties=PhysicalProperties.new(0.01,0.3,0.5) b.Position=pos+Vector3.new(0,1,0) b.AssemblyLinearVelocity=Vector3.new(math.random(-45,45),math.random(25,65),math.random(-45,45)) task.delay(1.5+math.random()*1.5,function() if b.Parent then puddle(b.Position,b.Size.X*2.5,math.random()<0.25) b:Destroy() end end) end task.delay(1,function() spawnItem("burrito",pos) end) end
function die(pet) pet.dying=true setPrompts(pet,"none") task.spawn(function() for n=1,40 do if not pet.p.Parent then return end pet.sc=pet.sc+0.035 pet.hl.FillColor=(n%2==0) and PURP or BLACK if n==31 then say(pet,"...thank you for trying...","hat") elseif n%10==1 then say(pet,R(L.dying)) end task.wait(0.1) end explode(pet) end) end function goEvil(pet) pet.evil=true pet.need=3 pet.stun=os.clock()+2.5 pet.sc=pet.sc+0.4 boom(pet.p.Position,4) local fc,oc,fic=RED,BLACK,RED
if pet.tail then fc,oc,fic=Color3.fromRGB(60,30,10),Color3.fromRGB(255,140,0),Color3.fromRGB(255,140,0) elseif pet.shoes then fc,oc,fic=Color3.fromRGB(255,200,60),Color3.fromRGB(200,80,0),Color3.fromRGB(255,200,60) elseif pet.clothes then fc,oc,fic=TAN,Color3.fromRGB(120,80,30),Color3.fromRGB(255,220,150) elseif pet.helmet then fc,oc,fic=Color3.fromRGB(60,160,60),Color3.fromRGB(20,80,20),Color3.fromRGB(120,220,80) elseif pet.belt then fc,oc,fic=Color3.fromRGB(230,180,90),Color3.fromRGB(120,70,20),Color3.fromRGB(255,220,150) elseif pet.backpack then fc,oc,fic=Color3.fromRGB(60,90,160),BLACK,Color3.fromRGB(120,160,255) elseif pet.classic then fc,oc,fic=Color3.fromRGB(220,220,220),BLACK,WHITE elseif pet.gear then fc,oc,fic=Color3.fromRGB(255,120,40),BLACK,Color3.fromRGB(255,200,60) elseif pet.ball then fc,oc,fic=Color3.fromRGB(255,130,40),BLACK,Color3.fromRGB(255,170,60) elseif pet.evilfox then fc,oc,fic=Color3.fromRGB(200,70,0),BLACK,Color3.fromRGB(255,120,0) end local hl=Instance.new("Highlight") hl.FillColor=fc hl.OutlineColor=oc hl.FillTransparency=0.4 hl.Parent=pet.p pet.hl=hl
local fi=Instance.new("Fire") fi.Color=fic fi.SecondaryColor=BLACK fi.Parent=pet.p pet.fire=fi pet.st.TextColor3=RED setPrompts(pet,"evil") if pet.tail then say(pet,R(TL.evil)) achieve("Behind You","a tail turned evil. dont look back... actually DO.") elseif pet.shoes then say(pet,R(X.legs)) achieve("Bawk","your shoes turned evil. dance with them.") elseif pet.clothes then say(pet,R(X.clothes)) achieve("Not Just a Jacket","your clothes were tortillas all along.") elseif pet.helmet then say(pet,R(X.helmet)) achieve("Crunch","an evil salad helmet. find ranch.") elseif pet.evilbeans then say(pet,R(X.evilbeans)) elseif pet.belt then say(pet,R(X.belt)) achieve("Twisted","a pretzel belt. same day as the churro.") elseif pet.backpack then say(pet,R(X.pack)) achieve("Pocket Dimension","your backpack wants you INSIDE") elseif pet.classic then say(pet,R(X.classic)) achieve("Since 2006","the classic tshirt remembers") elseif pet.gear then say(pet,R(X.gear)) achieve("Lunch Strikes Back","your food gear remembers every bite")
elseif pet.ball then say(pet,R(X.ball)) achieve("Hot Dog Curse","gerald dropped a hot dog at the stadium") elseif pet.evilfox then say(pet,R(X.evilfox)) achieve("The EVIL Fox","a neglected tail became an evil fox") else say(pet,R(L.evil)) end end function unEvil(pet) pet.evil=false pet.super=false pet.evilfox=false pet.superfox=false pet.folds=0 pet.hyperT=nil pet.hugs=0 pet.poison=0 pet.rage=1 pet.hunger=50 pet.love=50 pet.sc=math.min(pet.sc,2.5) if pet.hl then pet.hl:Destroy() pet.hl=nil end if pet.fire then pet.fire:Destroy() pet.fire=nil end pet.st.TextColor3=WHITE setPrompts(pet,"cute") sparkle(pet.p,GOLD) say(pet,R(L.freed),"hat") end local function goSuper(pet) pet.super=true pet.need=5 pet.hl.FillColor=BLACK pet.hl.OutlineColor=PURP pet.fire.Color=PURP pet.fire.SecondaryColor=BLACK pet.fire.Size=10
